WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.949 --> 00:00:12.116
- For this video, my mom is
dressing me for a whole week.

00:00:49.777 --> 00:00:51.457
We did a similar thing two years ago,

00:00:51.457 --> 00:00:53.170
where she chose one outfit for me.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:54.170
You like it?

00:02:27.316 --> 00:02:28.784
I feel super hot right now.

00:02:28.784 --> 00:02:30.496
I can't wait to slip into shorts.

00:02:30.496 --> 00:02:32.068
I'm not used to wearing sweats,

00:02:32.068 --> 00:02:34.380
and like, this hoodie, all day long.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.908
Thick cotton material.

00:02:35.908 --> 00:02:37.814
People had opinions all over the place,

00:02:37.814 --> 00:02:41.231
definitely feel a lot younger, cooler ...

00:02:58.276 --> 00:03:01.455
- Like a ... artsy cool side
that I never dress myself in.

00:03:01.455 --> 00:03:02.538
What is this?

00:03:24.714 --> 00:03:28.422
- I am not used to expressing
myself in such loud colors,

00:03:28.422 --> 00:03:30.907
kind of like a fun side of
me that my mom pulled out.

00:03:30.907 --> 00:03:32.562
A childhood side of me

00:03:32.562 --> 00:03:35.847
that I've not gotten in
touch with in a while.

00:03:35.847 --> 00:03:37.191
I'm pleasantly surprised.

00:03:37.191 --> 00:03:39.941
I would probably wear this again.

00:04:04.898 --> 00:04:06.620
- What the semi-turtleneck is this?

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.754
I've never worn this
color ever in my life.

00:04:08.754 --> 00:04:11.438
I'm normally very particular
with the type of hat

00:04:11.438 --> 00:04:14.763
that I wear, I usually have
a specific shape that I like,

00:04:14.763 --> 00:04:15.964
and this is not it.

00:04:15.964 --> 00:04:17.690
It makes my head too flat.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.474
Wait til you see this text.

00:04:19.474 --> 00:04:20.706
Also looks like prescription.

00:04:20.706 --> 00:04:21.818
I'm reading it by word,

00:04:21.818 --> 00:04:23.806
because I'm reading it--
- [Lien] I-den-tee-fee.

00:04:23.806 --> 00:04:25.998
- What is this?
- In-te-freh.

00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:27.652
- What? In Asia, you know how those memes,

00:04:27.652 --> 00:04:30.112
it'll say like, cuss words
with flowers around it,

00:04:30.112 --> 00:04:30.945
it just doesn't matter.

00:04:30.945 --> 00:04:32.524
It's just words and font.

00:04:32.524 --> 00:04:36.024
Obviously, the words on here don't matter.

00:04:38.223 --> 00:04:40.306
- I really like it a lot.

00:04:48.266 --> 00:04:50.099
- [Kane] Uh huh. Yeah.

00:05:12.335 --> 00:05:15.227
- I'm not mad about it. Your
mom did a really good job.

00:05:15.227 --> 00:05:17.121
This color on you is everything, like--

00:05:17.121 --> 00:05:17.954
- Yeah?

00:05:17.954 --> 00:05:21.371
- You need to wear this color more often.

00:05:23.841 --> 00:05:24.970
- I'm starting to think that my mom

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.517
might be more fashionable than I am,

00:05:26.517 --> 00:05:29.369
because some of the Instagram
photos that I posted

00:05:29.369 --> 00:05:33.536
have three times the likes that
my normal photos would get.

00:06:42.745 --> 00:06:44.865
- I'm going to a friend's
birthday party today.

00:06:44.865 --> 00:06:47.637
This is 100% something my dad would wear.

00:06:47.637 --> 00:06:50.265
This pattern, this polka dot pattern.

00:06:50.265 --> 00:06:52.437
I've actually never had
a real watch before.

00:06:52.437 --> 00:06:54.253
I've had an Apple watch, but like,

00:06:54.253 --> 00:06:56.549
I've never actually had a legit watch.

00:06:56.549 --> 00:06:57.433
I look like a dad.

00:06:57.433 --> 00:06:59.337
This pair of shoes,
pretty simple and clean.

00:06:59.337 --> 00:07:02.881
Good job. What do you think, mom?

00:07:02.881 --> 00:07:05.217
- Oh! So handsome boy.

00:07:05.217 --> 00:07:06.964
Yeah, so I hug you.

00:07:06.964 --> 00:07:10.464
- Okay. What do you think about the watch?

00:07:14.409 --> 00:07:16.872
- I'm actually surprised that
your mom is quite stylish.

00:07:16.872 --> 00:07:19.872
- It's very hip. It's very shocking.

00:07:25.278 --> 00:07:26.829
- I was actually very surprised.

00:07:26.829 --> 00:07:28.991
Literally none of the clothes she chose,

00:07:28.991 --> 00:07:31.832
I would've chosen for me
now, but after wearing it,

00:07:31.832 --> 00:07:35.999
there were definitely items
that I would wear again.

00:07:40.405 --> 00:07:43.338
- Update! It's been a few weeks
since I filmed with my mom.

00:07:43.338 --> 00:07:46.023
What's wild is that I had no
idea this whole experience

00:07:46.023 --> 00:07:48.155
would impact my style so much.

00:07:48.155 --> 00:07:50.239
Literally, if you look at my Instagram,

00:07:50.239 --> 00:07:51.967
I have a completely new look,

00:07:51.967 --> 00:07:54.067
my wardrobe is completely different.

00:07:54.067 --> 00:07:55.339
I had no idea that in my 20s,

00:07:55.339 --> 00:07:58.024
my mother would refresh my wardrobe.

00:07:58.024 --> 00:07:59.167
What?

00:07:59.167 --> 00:08:00.755
Just started getting into watches,

00:08:00.755 --> 00:08:02.870
I've started wearing
different types of hats,

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.699
just more color in general.

00:08:04.699 --> 00:08:06.558
Jumping over that hurdle
about like, this is not me,

00:08:06.558 --> 00:08:07.851
I look awkward in it.

00:08:07.851 --> 00:08:10.475
The fact that I did it,
and things were okay,

00:08:10.475 --> 00:08:12.451
now I feel a little bit more daring.

00:08:12.451 --> 00:08:15.335
This video has probably
impacted my style the most,

00:08:15.335 --> 00:08:17.091
out of all the videos that I've done.

00:08:17.091 --> 00:08:18.291
So thank you, mom!

00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:20.659
Let me know which one
is your favorite outfit

00:08:20.659 --> 00:08:23.435
which one should I
continue wearing more of,

00:08:23.435 --> 00:08:27.435
and would you let your
mom dress you for a week?

00:08:29.825 --> 00:08:31.590
(laughter)

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:34.090
(house music)

